<%# One page-level live region for mutations that are not submitted from a modal,
    such as a row delete or a request that never reached a form. A short
    confirmation is visually hidden and only announced; a failure renders a
    visible alert and takes focus. The refreshed page starts empty again. %>
<div class="mutation-status" data-mutation-status role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1" hidden></div>
